  "format": "kdig",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Ring and Johnson counters",
  "description": "A shift register fed back on itself. The ring counter circulates a single 1 (4 states); the Johnson counter feeds back the inverse of the last stage (8 states). RST goes back to the start.",
